      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_27",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            x: 19,
            y: 42,
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "variable",
                name: "timesForever",
                greater_than_or_equal_to: 3,
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "switch",
            variable: "reflectionPool",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: 0,
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Mal Keshar",
                    text: _("I remember this place. It swirls with strange energy, like a pool of memories."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "spawn",
                    id: "Drogan",
                    type: "Lieutenant",
                    side: 5,
                    x: 20,
                    y: 43,
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:spawn_unit",
                    unit: "Drogan",
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Drogan",
                    text: _("D’ya still ’member tha good ol’ days? When you were little, ’n yer father had no time fer ya, we used ta train together in tha fields. Just you ’n me fer hours on end, practicin’ with our swords ’n havin’ fun."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Drogan",
                    text: _("It were so much simpler back then, without yer complicated magic ’n yer crazy education ta mess things up. Don’t ya think so, Malin?"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:delay",
                    time: 1500,
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Mal Keshar",
                    text: _("That name is no longer mine."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:kill_unit",
                    unit: "Drogan",
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                    variable: "reflectionPool",
                    value: 1,
                    mode: "add",
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: 1,
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Mal Keshar",
                    text: _("What does the darkness have in store for me this time?"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "spawn",
                    id: "Dela_Keshar",
                    type: "Frontier Baroness",
                    side: 5,
                    x: 20,
                    y: 43,
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:spawn_unit",
                    unit: "Dela_Keshar",
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Dela Keshar",
                    text: _("I guess we were never that close, but you were still my brother. When you went to Alduin fer those eight years, I was so lonely, ya know? Bein’ the daughter of a baron, it was real hard to make any real friends. It was always just people tryin’ to be nice and friendly just to get something out of me. People didn’t care about me. They only cared about my title."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Dela Keshar",
                    text: _("When you first came back from Alduin, I was so, so happy to see ya. I thought you and me and pa could finally be a family again and I’d finally have someone I could talk to as just, you know, a friend. And then ya went and screwed it all up by turnin’ to that dark magic of yours. You don’t know how much that hurt me. You really don’t, Malin."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:delay",
                    time: 1500,
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Mal Keshar",
                    text: _("That is not my name."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:kill_unit",
                    unit: "Dela Keshar",
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                    variable: "reflectionPool",
                    value: 1,
                    mode: "add",
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: 2,
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "spawn",
                    id: "Darken_Volk",
                    type: "Necromancer",
                    side: 5,
                    x: 20,
                    y: 43,
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:spawn_unit",
                    unit: "Darken_Volk",
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Darken Volk",
                    text: _("A necromancer’s existence is a solitary one. Though we may be surrounded by hordes of the undead, it is a scarce occasion that we interact with another truly sentient being. In all my years of travels, you were my first and only apprentice."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Darken Volk",
                    text: _("I taught you everything I knew. I imparted you with all the power you needed to accomplish your goals. I thought that in return, you would afford me a single, small favor, and that I would not ask more of you. How did you repay me? By betraying me using the very skills I taught you! You are a cursed soul, Mal Keshar the Damned!"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:kill_unit",
                    unit: "Darken Volk",
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:delay",
                    time: 1500,
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Mal Keshar",
                    text: _("Hah."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Mal Keshar",
                    text: _("Hahahahaha."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Mal Keshar",
                    text: _("<i>HAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA.</i>"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:delay",
                    time: 1500,
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Mal Keshar",
                    text: _("That is indeed my name."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:set_achievement",
                    id: "did_reflection",
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                    variable: "reflectionPool",
                    value: 1,
                    mode: "add",
                  },
                ],
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_30",
        on: "branch_if_30",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "x1",
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_condition_tree",
                tree: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22and%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22variable%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22y1%22%2C%22numerical_equals%22%3A%2227%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_condition_tree",
                tree: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22and%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22variable%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22timesForever%22%2C%22greater_than%22%3A%225%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "second",
            text: _("Boss, look! The lich dropped a shiny book!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "speakinghero",
            text: _("Well, what is it?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "second",
            text: _("I don’t know, but it looks like someone wrote something inside! It says:"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "items/book2.png",
            text: _("<i>That stupid memory came back to bother me again today. It was that time at the Academy when Zephrin and I were arguing about orcs. I still remember that hoarse voice of his telling me, ‘Fun story, Malin, but you really should put a disclaimer. You know, to make sure everyone understands no orcs were harmed in the making of this story, hahaha.’ I can still hear his infernal cackling ringing in my head. Sure thing, Zephrin, right... like my whole life was some sort of work of fiction!</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "speakinghero",
            text: _("Bah! Do these people believe that we are fools? They must think we are all actors in a poorly written drama! I’ve had enough of this. I’m going home."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_31",
        on: "branch_if_31",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_condition_tree",
                tree: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22not%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22and%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22variable%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22x1%22%2C%22numerical_equals%22%3A%2217%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22and%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22variable%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22y1%22%2C%22numerical_equals%22%3A%2227%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22and%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22variable%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22timesForever%22%2C%22greater_than%22%3A%225%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "speakinghero",
            text: _("Anyway, round up the wolves. I’m going home."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_29",
        on: "branch_if_29",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "timesForever",
            greater_than_or_equal_to: 3,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "journeys_end.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "switch",
            variable: "hero_type",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "human",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Mal Keshar",
                    text: _("Slain by those who were once my countrymen..."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:kill_unit",
                    unit: "Mal Keshar",
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "speakinghero",
                    text: _("His evil deeds have come to an end."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "second",
                    text: _("Who do you think he was before he was corrupted by the darkness?"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "speakinghero",
                    text: _("It matters not. He embraced death over life, and thus relinquished his right to mercy. Let us return home; the town will need us to defend against the orcish raids."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "second",
                    text: _("Yes, sir."),
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "bandit",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Mal Keshar",
                    text: _("Darkness descends... and I..."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:kill_unit",
                    unit: "Mal Keshar",
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "speakinghero",
                    text: _("It’s done. He’ll trouble us no more."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "second",
                    text: _("Who do you think he was before becoming a lich?"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "speakinghero",
                    text: _("Likely one of those arrogant mages who think themselves superior to everyone else. He probably learned necromancy just to subjugate people like us."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "second",
                    text: _("So he was an evil tyrant. How dreadful."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "speakinghero",
                    text: _("Probably. Anyway, there’s no use in dwelling upon one so wicked. Let’s go."),
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "elf",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Mal Keshar",
                    text: _("Darkness descends... and I..."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:kill_unit",
                    unit: "Mal Keshar",
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "speakinghero",
                    text: _("Well, that is the end of his evil ways."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "second",
                    text: _("I wonder who this lich was in life before he turned to the evil that is undeath."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "speakinghero",
                    text: _("A selfish human, only greedy for power while utterly indifferent to anything but himself. A necromancer’s only purpose is to work for their own gain, nothing else."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "second",
                    text: _("Pure evil, that is what they are."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "speakinghero",
                    text: _("Indeed. We need not afford this one any compassion. Let us leave this miserable place."),
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "dwarf",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Mal Keshar",
                    text: _("Darkness descends... and I..."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:kill_unit",
                    unit: "Mal Keshar",
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "speakinghero",
                    text: _("Tha lich be nae but a pile o’ bones now."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "second",
                    text: _("I wonder what kind o’ human he did be in life."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "speakinghero",
                    text: _("Me guess be that he be some loonie mage who wanted ta make other humans inta ’is slaves. Why else d’ye think tha lad woul’ turn ta dark magic?"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "second",
                    text: _("I dinna know. Ye think tha lich’s castle can be useful?"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "speakinghero",
                    text: _("Aye. Let’s git to workin’."),
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "orc",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Mal Keshar",
                    text: _("Felled by an orc... so it ends... like this..."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:kill_unit",
                    unit: "Mal Keshar",
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "speakinghero",
                    text: _("The lich is dead! I have finally avenged my father."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "second",
                    text: _("Who you think he was, boss?"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "speakinghero",
                    text: _("Just some angst-ridden mage who turned to dark magic when he swore some stupid quest for revenge upon us. Amusing that he was more bothersome in death than in life. Annoying that it took so long to kill him."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:fire_event",
                    event: "branch_if_30",
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:fire_event",
                    event: "branch_if_31",
                  },
                ],
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
